{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Take the head of the sons of Gershon, them too.</b> Even though I commanded you to count the sons of Kehat first, because the essential labor — such as the Ark, the Table, the Menorah, and the Altars — is laid upon them, as it says, ״כי עבודת הקדש עליהם״ etc., do not withhold counting after them the sons of Gershon, even though they do not carry anything and serve with wagons — for he was the firstborn among the sons of Levi, and his due is to be counted second."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:27.707409621Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}